{
    "chapter_num": 13,
    "verses_count": 33,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Remaining Land to Be Conquered"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now Joshua was old, advanced in years. And the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " said to him: “You are old, advanced in years, and there remains very much land yet to be possessed. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "This is the land that yet remains: all the territory of the Philistines and all "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that of"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the Geshurites, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "from Sihor, which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " east of Egypt, as far as the border of Ekron northward ("
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "which"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " is counted as Canaanite); the five lords of the Philistines—the Gazites, the Ashdodites, the Ashkelonites, the Gittites, and the Ekronites; also the Avites; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "from the south, all the land of the Canaanites, and Mearah that belongs to the Sidonians as far as Aphek, to the border of the Amorites; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the land of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or Giblites"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Gebalites, and all Lebanon, toward the sunrise, from Baal Gad below Mount Hermon as far as the entrance to Hamath; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "all the inhabitants of the mountains from Lebanon as far as the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Heb. Misrephoth Maim, lit. Burnings of Water"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Brook Misrephoth, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " all the Sidonians—them I will drive out from before the children of Israel; only divide"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "apportion"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " it by lot to Israel as an inheritance, as I have commanded you. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now therefore, divide this land as an inheritance to the nine tribes and half the tribe of Manasseh.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Land Divided East of the Jordan"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "With the other half-tribe the Reubenites and the Gadites received their inheritance, which Moses had given them, beyond the Jordan eastward, as Moses the servant of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " had given them: "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "from Aroer which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " on the bank of the River Arnon, and the town that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in the midst of the ravine, and all the plain of Medeba as far as Dibon; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "all the cities of Sihon king of the Amorites, who reigned in Heshbon, as far as the border of the children of Ammon; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Gilead, and the border of the Geshurites and Maachathites, all Mount Hermon, and all Bashan as far as Salcah; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "all the kingdom of Og in Bashan, who reigned in Ashtaroth and Edrei, who remained of the remnant of the giants; for Moses had "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. struck"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "defeated and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "dispossessed"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "cast out these."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Nevertheless the children of Israel did not drive out the Geshurites or the Maachathites, but the Geshurites and the Maachathites dwell among the Israelites until this day."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Only to the tribe of Levi he had given "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "no land as a possession"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "no inheritance; the sacrifices of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " God of Israel made by fire "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " their inheritance, as He said to them."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Land of Reuben"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Moses had given to the tribe of the children of Reuben "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "an inheritance"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " according to their families. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Their territory was from Aroer, which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " on the bank of the River Arnon, and the city that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in the midst of the ravine, and all the plain by Medeba; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Heshbon and all its cities that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in the plain: Dibon, Bamoth Baal, Beth Baal Meon, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Jahaza, Kedemoth, Mephaath, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Kirjathaim, Sibmah, Zereth Shahar on the mountain of the valley, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Beth Peor, the slopes of Pisgah, and Beth Jeshimoth— "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "all the cities of the plain and all the kingdom of Sihon king of the Amorites, who reigned in Heshbon, whom Moses had struck with the princes of Midian: Evi, Rekem, Zur, Hur, and Reba, who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " princes of Sihon dwelling in the country. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The children of Israel also killed with the sword Balaam the son of Beor, the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "diviner"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "soothsayer, among those who were killed by them. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the border of the children of Reuben was the bank of the Jordan. This "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the inheritance of the children of Reuben according to their families, the cities and their villages."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Land of Gad"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Moses also had given "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "an inheritance"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to the tribe of Gad, to the children of Gad according to their families. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Their territory was Jazer, and all the cities of Gilead, and half the land of the Ammonites as far as Aroer, which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " before Rabbah, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and from Heshbon to Ramath Mizpah and Betonim, and from Mahanaim to the border of Debir, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and in the valley Beth Haram, Beth Nimrah, Succoth, and Zaphon, the rest of the kingdom of Sihon king of Heshbon, with the Jordan as "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "its"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " border, as far as the edge of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Sea of Galilee"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Sea of Chinnereth, on the other side of the Jordan eastward. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "This "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the inheritance of the children of Gad according to their families, the cities and their villages."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Half the Tribe of Manasseh (East)"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Moses also had given "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "an inheritance"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to half the tribe of Manasseh; it was for half the tribe of the children of Manasseh according to their families: "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Their territory was from Mahanaim, all Bashan, all the kingdom of Og king of Bashan, and all the towns of Jair which are in Bashan, sixty cities; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "half of Gilead, and Ashtaroth and Edrei, cities of the kingdom of Og in Bashan, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " for the children of Machir the son of Manasseh, for half of the children of Machir according to their families."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 32,
                    "num_str": "32",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "These "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are the areas"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " which Moses had "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "apportioned"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "distributed as an inheritance in the plains of Moab on the other side of the Jordan, by Jericho eastward. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 33,
                    "num_str": "33",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But to the tribe of Levi Moses had given no inheritance; the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " God of Israel "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " their inheritance, as He had said to them."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}